<https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/cda/document-core/ValueSet/fr-valueset-status-code> a fhir:ValueSet ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:id [ fhir:v "fr-valueset-status-code"] ; # 
  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : ValueSet fr-valueset-status-code</b></p><a name=\"fr-valueset-status-code\"> </a><a name=\"hcfr-valueset-status-code\"> </a><ul><li>Include ce(s) code(s) tel qu'il(s) est (sont) défini(s) dans <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActStatus.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActStatus</code></a><span title=\"La version est explicitement indiquée comme étant 5.0.0\"> version ?5.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Affichage</b></td><td><b>Définition</b></td></tr><tr><td><code>completed</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">completed</td><td>An Act that has terminated normally after all of its constituents have been performed.</td></tr><tr><td><code>active</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">active</td><td>The Act can be performed or is being performed</td></tr><tr><td><code>aborted</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">aborted</td><td>The Act has been terminated prior to the originally intended completion.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet fr-valueset-status-code</b></p><a name=\"en-fr-valueset-status-code\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcfr-valueset-status-code\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActStatus.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActStatus</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 5.0.0\"> version ?5.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><code>completed</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">completed</td><td>An Act that has terminated normally after all of its constituents have been performed.</td></tr><tr><td><code>active</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">active</td><td>The Act can be performed or is being performed</td></tr><tr><td><code>aborted</code></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">aborted</td><td>The Act has been terminated prior to the originally intended completion.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
